# api_takeoff_refused_mode.scn — an API `takeoff` that the pre-arm check refuses leaves no trace: nothing is published, the flight mode is never changed
#                                ARM 前判定が拒否する API `takeoff` は痕跡を残さない: 何も発行せず、飛行モードは変わらない
#
# Since the up-front refusal (takeoffRefusalText reads the published arm_block) the refusal is answered by ApiTask ("error pairing in progress") before the verb is published, so the
# mode change and StateManager's restore (steps 1-2 below) no longer happen; the restore stays in StateManager as the backstop for a refusal that ApiTask could not know.
# 上の拒否（takeoffRefusalText が発行済みの arm_block を読む）で、拒否は verb の発行前に ApiTask が "error pairing in progress" で応答するので、
# モードの切り替えと StateManager の復元（下の 1・2）は起きなくなった。復元は ApiTask が知り得なかった拒否に備える StateManager の最後の備えとして残る。
#
# RUN WITH --unpaired so the vehicle boots UNPAIRED (the pairing handshake is then still open and refuses every ARM):
#   sf sils scenario simulator/sils/scenarios/api_takeoff_refused_mode.scn --target vehicle --unpaired --duration 16000000
#
# Only the API talks to the craft at first (no transmitter packet has arrived, so nothing re-arbitrates the flight mode on the ground).
#   1. `takeoff` switches the ground mode to POS_HOLD and requests the ARM; the ARM is refused ("ARM rejected: pairing in progress").
#   2. StateManager::requestArmForTakeoff puts the previous mode (STABILIZE) back at once, before any transmitter packet exists.
#   3. A transmitter then binds and its ARM press is accepted: the craft is armed in STABILIZE (manual throttle), so no automatic takeoff starts.
# A mode left in POS_HOLD would have made that ARM start an auto-takeoff under the user's hand (detailed_design.md §3.1, API takeoff row).
#
# 最初は API だけが機体に話しかける（送信機の電文はまだ届いておらず、地上で飛行モードを調停し直すものはない）。
#   1. `takeoff` は地上のモードを POS_HOLD に切り替えて ARM を要求する。ARM は拒否される（"ARM rejected: pairing in progress"）。
#   2. StateManager::requestArmForTakeoff が、送信機の電文が届く前に、以前のモード（STABILIZE）へ直ちに戻す。
#   3. その後に送信機が bind し、その ARM 押下が受理される: 機体は STABILIZE（手動スロットル）で ARM し、自動離陸は始まらない。
# モードが POS_HOLD のまま残っていれば、この ARM は使う人の手の下で自動離陸を始める（detailed_design.md §3.1、API 離陸の行）。
#
#  <t>  ch        <thr> <roll> <pitch> <yaw> <arm> <hold_ms> <rate_hz>
   6000 api        "command"                                          # A: t=6 s — enter SDK mode (calibration done, pairing still open)
   +    api        "takeoff"                                          # B: ground mode -> POS_HOLD, ARM refused (pairing), mode restored
   8000 rc         2048  2048   2048    2048  0     3000      50      # C: t=8 s — the transmitter binds (first packet), disarmed 3 s
   +    rc         2048  2048   2048    2048  1     4000      50      # D: t=11 s — ARM press accepted in STABILIZE, idle throttle 4 s (to t=15)
